<Base title="India" description="The regulatory and legal situation for tobacco harm reduction products in India.">
  <h1>Tobacco harm reduction in India</h1>
  <p>
    India has an estimated 100+ million adult smokers and around 200 million
    users of smokeless tobacco — more smokeless users than smokers. This
    section covers the current legal position on lower-risk alternatives,
    and the history of legal challenges to state and national bans.
  </p>
